{"term": {"label": "智", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "1B", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/liang-hui-wang-ii", "title": "梁惠王下", "description": "莊暴見孟子，曰：「暴見於王，王語暴以好樂，暴未有以對也。」曰：「好樂何如？」\n孟子曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊國其庶幾乎！」\n他日，見於王曰：「王嘗語莊子以好樂，有諸？」王變乎色，曰：「寡人非能好先王之樂也，直好世俗之樂耳。」\n曰：「王之好樂甚，則齊其庶幾乎！今之樂猶古之樂也。」曰：「可得聞與？」\n曰：「獨樂樂，與人樂樂，孰", "occurrences": 1, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "事", "id": "事"}, {"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "免", "id": "免"}, {"form": "勇", "id": "勇"}, {"form": "問", "id": "問"}, {"form": "國", "id": "國"}, {"form": "大", "id": "大"}, {"form": "大王", "id": "大王"}, {"form": "天", "id": "天"}, {"form": "小", "id": "小"}, {"form": "怒", "id": "怒"}, {"form": "智", "variants": [], "id": "智"}, {"form": "民", "id": "民"}, {"form": "畏", "id": "畏"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "請", "id": "請"}], "edges": [{"weight": 1.8803128665695001, "source": "勇", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 2.691243082785829, "source": "勇", "target": "請"}, {"weight": 0.6435502394205732, "source": "勇", "target": "民"}, {"weight": 2.2857779746776643, "source": "問", "target": "國"}, {"weight": 1.9673242435591298, "source": "問", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.6796421711073488, "source": "國", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.4384801142904609, "source": "國", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 1.7749523509116738, "source": "國", "target": "畏"}, {"weight": 1.1871656860095547, "source": "國", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 1.5926307941177191, "source": "國", "target": "事"}, {"weight": 3.3843902633457743, "source": "國", "target": "免"}, {"weight": 2.691243082785829, "source": "請", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 1.8803128665695001, "source": "請", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 1.6796421711073488, "source": "請", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 0.5257672037641897, "source": "民", "target": "小"}, {"weight": 0.7305616164102029, "source": "民", "target": "大"}, {"weight": 1.3366974199805186, "source": "民", "target": "怒"}, {"weight": 0.08393445148515048, "source": "民", "target": "天"}, {"weight": 2.41